   $q$What is the author's point of view in this passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"People should try to repair items before throwing them away.","is_correct":true},{"text":"People should never replace anything, even if it is unsafe.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"exaggerates-position"},{"text":"People should volunteer at the community center every week.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"People should buy new items because prices are often low.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-opposing-view"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$People should try to repair items before throwing them away.$q$, $q$The author says, "I believe we should try to fix things before we throw them away." The author agrees a heater with a cracked cord should be replaced, so "never replace anything" goes too far.$q$, 'draft', '0c47699a-603d-5c95-935b-8305ebd84dc1')
