   $q$According to the passage, what did a lamplighter do near dawn?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He reported every lamp to the electric company.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He switched the lamps off from a central station.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-time-period"},{"text":"He walked his route again to turn the lamps off.","is_correct":true},{"text":"He lit the lamps again to brighten the morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$He walked his route again to turn the lamps off.$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 says that near dawn the lamplighter "walked the same route again to turn the lamps off." A central station was used later for electric lights, not by lamplighters.$q$, 'draft', '5a0745b1-5ec2-5359-a0f2-84878d4b04ea')
