  ('fe20c525-1d05-51d5-a411-82f0195d237d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g7-evidence-inference'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Based on the passage, what most likely helped cause the mural to fade?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Poor paints that the artist chose when the mural was first made.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Sunlight, since the team finished by adding a layer that blocks it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Strong chemicals that earlier workers had used to clean the wall.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Cracks in the plaster that slowly drained the color from the paint.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sunlight, since the team finished by adding a layer that blocks it.$q$, $q$The team protected the repaired mural with a coating "that blocks sunlight," which suggests sunlight had damaged it before. The passage never says anyone used chemicals on the wall in the past.$q$, 'draft', '8d455f9d-ae93-5a51-8119-0094b90628c0')
