   $q$The author writes that "the clock cleared its throat with a soft whir." What does this personification describe?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The clock was broken again and made a grinding noise.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The clock made a small sound as it started running again.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Mateo coughed while he leaned over the clock to listen.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-subject"},{"text":"Grandpa spoke quietly to the clock to encourage it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The clock made a small sound as it started running again.$q$, $q$A person clears their throat before speaking, so the clock's "soft whir" is a small sound right before it "began to tick." The clock was working, not broken, which is why Mateo grinned.$q$, 'draft', 'd65270b0-2b8f-5ced-95de-c4c1fd0ad78c')
