values
  ('c140118f-19ef-56c6-9d90-58741ac47665', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g7-figurative-language'), null, 'hard',
   $q$At the end, Grandpa says, "Patience is the best tool in this whole shop." What does he mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The pliers were the most useful tool for fixing the bent pin.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-literal"},{"text":"Mateo should wait until he is older before he repairs clocks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He keeps a special tool named \"Patience\" hanging on the wall.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Calm, careful effort mattered more in the repair than any single tool.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Calm, careful effort mattered more in the repair than any single tool.$q$, $q$The repair took "two hours" of cleaning "each wheel" and checking "each tooth," so Grandpa uses a metaphor to say patience solved the problem. The pliers helped, but Grandpa is praising the slow, careful work, not a real tool.$q$, 'draft', 'd65270b0-2b8f-5ced-95de-c4c1fd0ad78c')
