   $q$Which statement best expresses the central idea of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Noise-canceling headphones reduce noise mainly by making opposite sound waves.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sound travels through the air as waves of high and low pressure.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Airplanes and buses are among the noisiest places people travel.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Padded ear cups are the most important part of any pair of headphones.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-key-idea"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Noise-canceling headphones reduce noise mainly by making opposite sound waves.$q$, $q$The passage explains how the headphones create an opposite wave that cancels noise, plus the limits of this method. The sound wave detail is background that helps explain the main idea, not the main idea itself.$q$, 'draft', '57630e0b-aecf-53bc-a0c0-e360656fc581')
