   $q$How does the fifth paragraph contribute to the development of the author's central claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It proves that every school already owns the tools that it needs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"It shows that the author has changed position on cooking classes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It adds a fourth reason that cooking makes students healthier.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It answers a likely objection, which makes the claim more convincing.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It answers a likely objection, which makes the claim more convincing.$q$, $q$Paragraph 5 admits that time and money are a fair concern and then explains that the class can be simple and cheap, which strengthens the argument. The author still supports the class, so the position has not changed.$q$, 'draft', '936e37eb-2b76-5e44-b323-e6ee4d0af433')
